  "title": "Patria Announces Date Change for its Fourth Quarter & Full Year 2025 Investor Call",
  "summary": "GRAND CAYMAN, Cayman Islands, Feb. 02, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Patria Investments Limited (“Patria”) (NASDAQ: PAX) announced today that it has changed the date it will release financial results for the fourth quarter and full year 2025 from Tuesday, February 10, 2026, to Tuesday, February 3, 2026,",
